---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Law, Simplified. provides general information about Indian law, not legal advice. Read the full disclaimer."
>
  <header class="disclaimer-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The fine print</p>
      <div class="disclaimer-head__grid">
        <h1>The <span class="italic">disclaimer.</span></h1>
        <div class="disclaimer-head__aside">
          <span class="stamp">Last reviewed {site.lastReviewed}</span>
          <p>
            The short version: this is general information, not legal advice. It does not create a
            lawyer–client relationship. For your facts, speak to a qualified advocate.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="disclaimer-body">
    <div class="container disclaimer-grid">
      <div class="prose disclaimer-prose">
        <h2>General information only</h2>
        <p>
          Law, Simplified. publishes general information about Indian law for educational purposes.
          It is not legal advice, and it is not a substitute for advice from a qualified advocate
          who has considered your specific facts, documents, and jurisdiction.
        </p>
        <p>
          Reading this website, using a template, or sending us an email does not create a
          lawyer–client relationship. We do not act for you, do not represent you before any court
          or authority, and do not monitor deadlines on your behalf.
        </p>

        <h2>No guarantee of accuracy or completeness</h2>
        <p>
          The law changes. Statutes are amended, rules are notified, fees are revised, and courts
          interpret provisions differently over time. We review the guides periodically, but we
          cannot guarantee that every page reflects the law on the day you read it, or that it
          covers every fact that matters in your situation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where a guide describes a state-specific rule, a procedure, or a fee, treat it as a
          starting point and verify it with the official source, the relevant authority, or a local
          advocate.
        </p>

        <h2>Jurisdiction</h2>
        <p>
          This website focuses on law in India. It does not address the law of other countries. Even
          within India, tenancy, labour, police, and court procedures can vary by state, union
          territory, and the forum hearing the matter.
        </p>

        <h2>Templates are starting points</h2>
        <p>
          The letters and complaints in the toolkit are general templates. They are not drafted for
          your matter. Before sending one, check the correct recipient, the applicable limitation
          period, the right forum, and whether any statement in the template is accurate for your
          facts. Do not sign or send a document you do not understand.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          We link to official portals, statutes, and other resources for convenience. We do not
          control those websites and are not responsible for their content, availability, or
          accuracy. A link is not an endorsement.
        </p>

        <h2>Emergencies and urgent matters</h2>
        <p>
          This website is not an emergency service. If you are in immediate danger, call
          <a href="tel:112">112</a>. If you are reporting a cyber fraud, call
          <a href="tel:1930">1930</a> and file at
          <a href="https://cybercrime.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cybercrime.gov.in</a>.
          Do not wait to read a guide first.
        </p>

        <h2>Free legal aid</h2>
        <p>
          If you cannot afford a lawyer, you may be eligible for free legal aid under the Legal
          Services Authorities Act, 1987. Contact your District Legal Services Authority or the
          National Legal Services Authority helpline at <a href="tel:15100">15100</a>. Eligibility
          and the scope of aid depend on the scheme and your circumstances.
        </p>

        <h2>Corrections</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe something on this site is inaccurate, out of date, or unclear, write to
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with the page and the correction. We
          review corrections and update the page where appropriate.
        </p>

        <div class="disclaimer-end">
          <Icon name="scale" size={22} />
          <p>
            The law belongs to everyone. Understanding it should not require a subscription.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="disclaimer-aside">
        <div class="aside-card">
          <h2>In short</h2>
          <ul role="list">
            <li><Icon name="check" size={14} /> General information, not legal advice.</li>
            <li><Icon name="check" size={14} /> No lawyer–client relationship.</li>
            <li><Icon name="check" size={14} /> Verify state-specific rules.</li>
            <li><Icon name="check" size={14} /> Templates need adaptation.</li>
            <li><Icon name="check" size={14} /> Emergencies: call 112.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="aside-card aside-card--help">
          <h2>Need a lawyer?</h2>
          <p>
            Your District Legal Services Authority can provide free legal aid if you qualify.
          </p>
          <a href="tel:15100" class="aside-card__phone">
            <Icon name="phone" size={16} /> 15100
          </a>
          <a href="https://nalsa.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="arrow-link">
            NALSA <Icon name="external" size={13} />
          </a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .disclaimer-head {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(229, 72, 47, 0.07), transparent 26%),
      var(--paper);
  }

  .disclaimer-head__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .disclaimer-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .disclaimer-head__aside {
    max-width: 26rem;
  }

  .disclaimer-head__aside .stamp {
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.45rem;
  }

  .disclaimer-head__aside p {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .disclaimer-body {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .disclaimer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .disclaimer-prose {
    counter-reset: section;
  }

  .disclaimer-prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .disclaimer-prose h2:first-child::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .disclaimer-prose p {
    max-width: 66ch;
  }

  .disclaimer-end {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.3rem;
    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .disclaimer-end svg {
    flex: none;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .disclaimer-end p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .disclaimer-aside {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .aside-card {
    padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem 1.3rem;
    background: var(--paper-bright);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .aside-card h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .aside-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .aside-card li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .aside-card li svg {
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .aside-card--help {
    border-top-color: var(--blue);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper-bright);
  }

  .aside-card--help h2 {
    color: rgba(255, 253, 245, 0.55);
  }

  .aside-card--help p {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(255, 253, 245, 0.7);
  }

  .aside-card__phone {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--paper-bright);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .aside-card--help .arrow-link {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--paper-bright);
    border-color: rgba(255, 253, 245, 0.4);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .disclaimer-head__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .disclaimer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 19rem;
      gap: 5rem;
    }

    .disclaimer-aside {
      position: sticky;
      top: 7rem;
    }
  }
</style>
